        "Solar forecasts (openmeteo_forecast.py). The same model on the hourly forecast made 24 hours ahead. An hourly value labelled h covers the hour before h and is given to its four quarter-hours. Hours missing from the forecast archive are filled with the actual solar 24 hours earlier, and the profile's note says how many. These profiles have the kind 'pvforecast', so they never appear as a choice in the app {gi_code_fc}.",
