        "Heat (when2heat.py). Heat demand in kW per kWh of yearly demand, so a house needing 15,000 kWh a year is the profile × 15,000. The efficiency for the mix of space heating and hot water is our own computation from the dataset's columns {mkt_heat_code}.",
